{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a265fffc-768a-8bd4-befc-dca29687f92a",
  "created_at": "2025-12-31T13:08:31-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "David Haddad",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:06:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. Happy New Year's Eve, almost. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:06:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes, good afternoon. My name is David Haddad. I am calling about, um, a shed. I have a shed in my yard and I want to move it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:07:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Where's the property, Mr. Haddad?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:07:04-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 105 Dixon Street, in the North End. [pause] The shed is already there, you understand. I only want to move it to the other side, near the back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:07:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So it's an existing shed, and you'd be relocating it within the same lot. Do you know roughly how big it is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:07:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, how do you say... pois, it is not so big. Maybe eight feet by ten feet, I think. [line breaks up] ...sorry, can you hear me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:07:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You cut out for a second, but I got eight by ten. Is it on a foundation, or just sitting on blocks or the ground?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:07:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just on the blocks. So moving it, this is a permit? Or no permit because it is already existing? I am not sure I understand which one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:07:43-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Moving a shed can count as a new placement, so it may need a shed permit, and the location matters because of setbacks from the property line. I'd rather confirm that with the zoning officer than have you guess."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:07:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And an inspection, is this needed also? Somebody must come to look?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:07:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sometimes, yes, depending on the permit. They'd tell you when you apply. Can I have a number for a callback?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:08:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is 401-555-0154. [pause] Oh, excuse me, my doorbell just sent a notification on the phone. It is the smart doorbell, it makes the noise. One moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:08:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:08:15-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is nothing, only a delivery. So, the permit for the shed, yes, and maybe inspection. I am still not sure which is which, but the officer will explain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:08:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. I'll send the note over, and someone will call you back and walk you through it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:08:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. Happy New Year to you."
    }
  ],
